        "statement": "As a pre-upgrade check for 0.16, any of these CRDs that still lists v1alpha1 in status.storedVersions is \"NOT SAFE\". The operator must remove v1alpha1 from the stored versions and make sure that status is persisted before upgrading, because the 0.16.0 CRDs no longer include the v1alpha1 version.",
