      "statement": "Before upgrading to 0.16.0, operators must make sure v1alpha1 is no longer listed in status.storedVersions of the externalsecrets, clusterexternalsecrets, secretstores and clustersecretstores CRDs. If it is listed, they must remove it and make sure the change is persisted, because the 0.16.0 chart drops the v1alpha1 version from these CRDs."
